<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Inventory</h1>
<p>Usage:
</p>
<pre><a cmd='#'>inventory</a>
</pre>
<p>You often need to see what you are carrying around. This command lists your 
entire inventory, but not what is inside your containers, and not the things 
you wear or use. To see those, use look in &lt;container&gt; and <a cmd='#'>equipment</a>.
</p><p>You can only carry so many things: ten, and one more for every ten points of 
dexterity. And you can only carry so much weight, more the stronger and bigger 
you are. What you wear and your coins don't count towards the number of things in your
hands, so wear what you can, and put small things in a bag or other container.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre>&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Equipment</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Wear</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Use</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Look</a>
</pre>




</div>